  "description": "SileroVad is a Voice Activity Detection (VAD) library developed in C#, with ONNX model decoding implemented under the hood using `Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime`. This library features the following: 1.Multi-framework support: Compatible with .NET Framework 4.6.1+, .NET 6.0+, .NET Core 3.1, and .NET Standard 2.0+; 2.Cross-platform capability: Supports Windows, macOS, Linux, and other systems, enabling cross-platform compilation; 3.Flexible deployment: Supports AOT (Ahead-of-Time) compilation and is simple and convenient to use.",
  "id": "ManySpeech.SileroVad",
